# AIDOS — Project invariants

- **Positioning (required reading)**: `docs/AIDOS-USP.md` — Governance-Aware Agentic Operational Intelligence; govern/observe/orchestrate enterprise AI operations (not “AI agents” or copilots as the headline).
- **Enterprise roadmap**: `docs/AIDOS-ENTERPRISE-ROADMAP.md` (Phases 0–7); **active build plan**: `docs/AIDOS-PHASE-1-EXECUTION.md`. MVP wedge: `docs/MVP-DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md`.
- **Product**: Governance and operational intelligence layer for AI-native delivery (human-governed; not an AI coding IDE).
- **MVP loop**: Discovery → Delivery DNA → Recommendations → Approvals.
- **Autonomy**: Recommend-only in MVP; no automated execution without approval.
- **Stack**: Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, Prisma 7 + PostgreSQL.
- **Tenancy**: All data scoped by `organizationId` from session.
- **Build**: Run `npm run build` before marking work complete.

Use `/frontend`, `/backend`, `/architect`, or `/orchestrator` subagents for specialized work.

**MVP plan:** `docs/MVP-DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md` — check sprint tasks and Section 4 status before starting work.
